{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"a65522f8adf49064c9e818e43c618c0798a30f2b0730b06118ada81de6ba2432","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"10419e2ec39499a69cf40dcc495d2c80d426c0390f5413e98031f4e6693a26cf","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"119af89312a36d7600832a7efc3ccad32e9fd116d081ded65cff5166411e63f0","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"120d3d48def6138fa01a3c4bcfd8a0951444c4c840f8a23638c3ba39c9ee38f0","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:135 原文“Just step on the plate here, and hold your arms like this so I can get the bindings in place...”：看管者是在把“bindings”（束缚）套到主角身上，译文“站在那里别动，举起胳膊，这样我就能把它放好”把束缚错成了“把它”，“plate”也漏掉了，这层被操控的含义因此丢失。另有几处偏离：“standard-issue alteration”被加成“标准化思维修改”（原文没有“思维”）；开头多出原文没有的“记住，”；第137行把“escape their notice for the first time since you arrived here”里的“自你来到这里后第一次”删掉了。"},{"revision_key":"12c3c45f81bdf4d981fef66a1e7df1fcef2e3da1d42e153350b255b078ed4a84","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"1be82f2f199d6d783d5293ac49acef643b763a0bc1a5ef1fabb39d94cd53aefe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"re-abducted.lua:29-30 只在 isCompleted(\"ambush\") 后显示这一行，所以它是“已经脱出伏击”的完成状态。“found your way out of”的意思是已经逃出去了，译文“你找到摆脱面前伏击的方法”却变成“找到了方法”，读起来像还没逃出。“primary”是首轮／主要伏击，不是“面前”。建议改作“你已从首轮伏击中脱身”。"},{"revision_key":"1dafd3a72823fbe74c63a3cb17629a8694d6bb6d50e54be3cc0ec89c87a2191f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"218c180b3f864dac59b93985e4631c2d6b566b1417cfa81b297286c57a8c2e0e","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"同一条目里 Urh'Rok 先译“乌尔洛克”，后面又译“乌鲁洛克”。同批 21d89ecd 和 295b84f0（乌鲁洛克之口）都用“乌鲁洛克”，专名前后不一致。“Divine Tournament of Tactics”的“锦标赛”被错写成“竞标赛”。“a mind given his direct, enthusiastic approval”的意思是其心智得到父亲直接而热切的认可，译成“精神受到父的指引”偏了原意。句首把“under the command and inspiration of Urh'Rok”从修饰“我们获救”改成了修饰“举办锦标赛”，关系挂错。“physical endurance”译“物理耐受”不妥，应为“体能耐力”。"},{"revision_key":"21d89ecd3e11c60fe85d124c2f93d5d0b6724bd13211828528f1d6ffca4c11a7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"demon.lua:83-89 有两处错别字改变了字义：“心中还坏着背叛父亲的深深愧疚”应为“怀着”；“赠予给我们他们所有用的科技”应为“所拥有的”。另外“prevent him from waking up unless disturbed”被译成“除非被强大的力量打扰”，原文没有“强大”。"},{"revision_key":"28ea98973ddf0d08e7eb5940be2d71fac43c10cbe3fc628304267189dd3945e2","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"295b84f066bb5e2610c84354d9f94de40a32ef9ded864d97373d29cbf3df47c5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"296765c04dd18b827507eb5e75e9d99280a590ea2208e9c1ada218a001d627f0","verdict":"OK"}]}